{"2874490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rusted Awakening", "steam_appid": 2874490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rusted Awakening</strong> is a short survival-horror FPS about escaping a decaying underground facility built to keep humanity asleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sleeping are everywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kept alive beneath the facility. Used in experiments. Drained to sustain the people who remain awake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those people have been awake far too long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some have become violent. Others still serve the machinery of the facility, hunting escaped subjects and forcing them back under.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You were never meant to wake up.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through rusted wards, laboratories, processing chambers and the machinery buried beneath humanity’s last refuge. Weapons are brutal. Ammunition matters. The people standing between you and the surface are desperate, unstable and heavily armed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But death is not the only threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sedators are trying to take you alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Syringes, gas and reclamation machinery drag you toward unconsciousness. Stay awake long enough and you may find something worse than death waiting beneath the facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wakefulness injections can pull you back from the edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a few violent seconds, your perception sharpens and the world seems to slow around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The same drugs have kept the others awake for far too long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There is only one way out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find the surface.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whatever happens, stay awake.</strong></p><p class=\